            "heading": "",
            "text": "VLSI and semiconductor careers cover chip design, verification, physical design, testing and manufacturing support, and you can show readiness with a small digital design and testbench, a clear grasp of digital logic and a project in a free toolchain."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Strong digital fundamentals and one complete design-and-verify project matter more than a long list of tool certificates."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Read notices, ask engineers in the field and check programme outcomes before paying fees."
          }
